=86=92 <a href=3D"https://www.kimi.com/code/docs/en/kimi-code-cli/reference=
/kimi-command.html#kimi-app"><code>kimi app</code></a></p><h4 id=3D"experim=
ental-progress-updates" tabindex=3D"-1">Experimental progress updates <a cl=
