=80=9CExperimental progress updates=E2=80=9D">=E2=80=8B</a></h4><p>NotifyUs=
er lets the Agent post short progress updates mid-turn. It is off by defaul=
t and can be enabled in the TUI <code>/experiments</code> panel or in the W=
