de/whats-new.html#interruptible-background-waits" aria-label=3D"Permalink t=
o =E2=80=9CInterruptible background waits=E2=80=9D">=E2=80=8B</a></h4><p><c=
ode>WaitFor</code> is capped at 90 seconds. While it waits, pressing <code>=
Enter</code> or <code>Ctrl-S</code> steers your message into the current tu=
rn and ends the wait early, while background tasks keep running. =E2=86=92 =
<a href=3D"https://www.kimi.com/code/docs/en/kimi-code-cli/guides/interacti=
on.html#during-streaming-output">During streaming output</a></p><p>Also in =
this release: fullscreen mode keeps a one-line summary of each user message=
