e multiple skills in one prompt=E2=80=9D">=E2=80=8B</a></h4><p>Type <code>/=
</code> after whitespace in the input to insert a skill tag =E2=80=94 a sin=
gle prompt can now activate multiple skills. Skill slash commands typed whi=
le the agent is busy are also queued instead of rejected. =E2=86=92 <a href=
