ml#invoking-a-skill">Invoking a Skill</a></p><h4 id=3D"web-session-manageme=
nt-upgrade" tabindex=3D"-1">Web session management upgrade <a class=3D"head=
er-anchor" href=3D"https://www.kimi.com/code/docs/en/kimi-code/whats-new.ht=
ml#web-session-management-upgrade" aria-label=3D"Permalink to =E2=80=9CWeb =
session management upgrade=E2=80=9D">=E2=80=8B</a></h4><p>The sidebar gains=
 Open / Done / Workspaces tabs, sessions can be marked as Done, and there's=
 a new dedicated session management page; the search dialog can now search =
workspaces and scrolls to the selected entry. =E2=86=92 <a href=3D"https://=
www.kimi.com/code/docs/en/kimi-code-cli/guides/web.html">Using Kimi Code in=
 the browser</a></p><h4 id=3D"auto-update-for-the-native-windows-cli" tabin=
dex=3D"-1">Auto-update for the native Windows CLI <a class=3D"header-anchor=
" href=3D"https://www.kimi.com/code/docs/en/kimi-code/whats-new.html#auto-u=
pdate-for-the-native-windows-cli" aria-label=3D"Permalink to =E2=80=9CAuto-=
update for the native Windows CLI=E2=80=9D">=E2=80=8B</a></h4><p>The single=
-file Windows CLI now updates itself =E2=80=94 no more manual downloads.</p=
><p>Also in this release: @-mentioned files, folders, and skills in chat me=
ssages render as icon capsules, and the browser tab title shows the current=
 workspace directory; the web Subagent panel is renamed to Background Agent=
; 0.37.1 fixes pasted images and videos failing to reach the model.</p></di=
v></div><div class=3D"wn-entry"><div class=3D"wn-meta"><span class=3D"wn-pr=
oduct">Kimi Code CLI</span><h2 id=3D"v0-36-0-august-13-2026" tabindex=3D"-1=
