st 13, 2026</span> <a class=3D"header-anchor" href=3D"https://www.kimi.com/=
code/docs/en/kimi-code/whats-new.html#v0-36-0-august-13-2026" aria-label=3D=
"Permalink to =E2=80=9Cv0.36.0 August 13, 2026=E2=80=9D">=E2=80=8B</a></h2>=
</div><div class=3D"wn-content"><h4 id=3D"subagent-model-pool" tabindex=3D"=
