=8B</a></h4><p>The official data plugin is now at v3.2.0, adding Chinese la=
ws, regulations, and judicial cases =E2=80=94 coverage now spans five data =
domains: stock market, macroeconomics, corporate registry, academic literat=
ure, and legal. =E2=86=92 <a href=3D"https://www.kimi.com/code/docs/en/kimi=
-code-cli/customization/plugins.html#kimi-datasource">Plugin overview</a></=
