=80=8B</a></h4><p>Import selected instructions, Skills, and MCP settings fr=
om Claude Code and Codex =E2=80=94 no need to reconfigure everything by han=
d when moving to Kimi Code. =E2=86=92 <a href=3D"https://www.kimi.com/code/=
docs/en/kimi-code-cli/reference/slash-commands.html#built-in-skill-commands=
">Built-in skill commands</a></p><p>Also in this release: the marketplace l=
ist now flags installed plugins that have updates available =E2=80=94 selec=
