#v0-12-0-june-9-2026" aria-label=3D"Permalink to =E2=80=9Cv0.12.0 June 9, 2=
026=E2=80=9D">=E2=80=8B</a></h2></div><div class=3D"wn-content"><h4 id=3D"s=
warm-multi-agent-parallel-tasks" tabindex=3D"-1"><code>/swarm</code> multi-=
