rm mode =E2=80=94 multiple agents work on the same objective in parallel, w=
ith live progress display and rate-limit-aware automatic retries. Swarm mod=
e exits automatically when the task completes. =E2=86=92 <a href=3D"https:/=
/www.kimi.com/code/docs/en/kimi-code-cli/reference/slash-commands.html#mode=
s-run-control">Slash commands</a></p><h4 id=3D"proxy-support" tabindex=3D"-=
1">Proxy support <a class=3D"header-anchor" href=3D"https://www.kimi.com/co=
de/docs/en/kimi-code/whats-new.html#proxy-support" aria-label=3D"Permalink =
to =E2=80=9CProxy support=E2=80=9D">=E2=80=8B</a></h4><p>The standard <code=
