s://www.kimi.com/code/docs/en/kimi-code-cli/configuration/env-vars.html">En=
vironment variables</a></p><h4 id=3D"goals-background-questions-and-sub-ski=
ll-discovery-are-now-stable" tabindex=3D"-1">Goals, background questions, a=
nd Sub-Skill discovery are now stable <a class=3D"header-anchor" href=3D"ht=
