<h2 id=3D"v0-1-0-may-2026" tabindex=3D"-1"><span class=3D"ignore-header">v0=
.1.0</span> <span class=3D"wn-date">May 2026</span> <a class=3D"header-anch=
or" href=3D"https://www.kimi.com/code/docs/en/kimi-code/whats-new.html#v0-1=
-0-may-2026" aria-label=3D"Permalink to =E2=80=9Cv0.1.0 May 2026=E2=80=9D">=
=E2=80=8B</a></h2></div><div class=3D"wn-content"><p><strong>Kimi Code CLI =
=E2=80=94 initial release.</strong> The entire codebase has been rewritten =
from Python / uv to TypeScript / Node.js. This isn't an incremental update =
=E2=80=94 it's a new foundation, with a redesigned architecture, installati=
on flow, and configuration format.</p><p>Key differences from the legacy ki=
mi-cli:</p><table tabindex=3D"0"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Legacy kimi-cli</t=
h><th>Kimi Code CLI</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Runtime</td><td>Python =
+ uv</td><td>Node.js (no Python dependency)</td></tr><tr><td>Install</td><t=
d><code>uv tool install</code></td><td>One-line <code>curl</code> script or=
 <code>npm install -g</code></td></tr><tr><td>Config file</td><td><code>~/.=
kimi/config.toml</code></td><td><code>~/.kimi-code/config.toml</code> (inco=
mpatible format)</td></tr><tr><td>Terminal UI</td><td>Basic text output</td=
><td>Full TUI (chat view + status bar + approval panel)</td></tr><tr><td>St=
artup speed</td><td>Slower (Python cold start)</td><td>Faster (Node.js nati=
ve binary)</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-provider</td><td>Limited</td><td>Built-in=
 Anthropic / OpenAI / Gemini / Vertex, and more</td></tr><tr><td>Sub-agents=
</td><td>Not supported</td><td>Built-in coder / explore / plan sub-agents</=
td></tr><tr><td>Plugin system</td><td>Not supported</td><td>Supported (sinc=
e v0.4.0)</td></tr><tr><td>Scheduled tasks</td><td>Not supported</td><td>Su=
pported (since v0.5.0)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Existing kimi-cli data (=
config, sessions, MCP declarations) can be migrated in one step with <code>=
kimi migrate</code>. =E2=86=92 <a href=3D"https://www.kimi.com/code/docs/en=
/kimi-code-cli/guides/migration.html">Version Upgrade</a></p></div></div></=
